=== judgement notes ===
Both clipping findings are mechanical: cells > 29 and settings_view.py:4020 truncates every row
label unconditionally, with no wrap path. Round 1 raised only an expansion-percentage nit here
and proposed a 32-cell replacement that would itself have clipped; it never measured
max_owner.label.

